#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  OS Routing Rules
#  File: os_routing_rules.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the autonomous routing layer that determines
#    which ARKA engine handles each incoming request.
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    • Registers engines with routing weights
#    • Routes requests based on:
#         - request type
#         - payload signature hashing
#         - engine weights
#         - manual overrides
#    • Reports engine failures to Supervisor Bridge
#    • Supports dynamic routing changes
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    register_engine(name, handler, weight)
#       → Registers engine + routing weight.
#
#    attach_supervisor(handler)
#       → Links Supervisor Bridge for escalation.
#
#    route(request_type, payload)
#       → Routes request to correct engine.
#
#    override(request_type, engine)
#       → Manual routing override.
#
#===============================================================================
#  RELATED MODULES:
